   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Forme",
     "md": "**will** + infinitif (même forme pour tous les sujets) : I **will** help you. · She **will** come. Contraction : **I'll**, **she'll**.\nNégation : **won't** (will not). Question : **Will** you come ? — Yes, I will. / No, I won't."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Emplois",
     "md": "- **Décision au moment de parler** : The phone is ringing. — I'll answer it.\n- **Promesse** : I will help you.\n- **Prévision** (opinion) : I think it **will** be hot tomorrow.\n- Avec : **I think…**, **probably**, **perhaps**."
    },
